01:33.620 --> 01:37.500
 -Spain- FC Cataluña's Practice Field

01:38.020 --> 01:40.950
There's big news from Italy!

01:40.950 --> 01:41.790
What's the matter?

01:42.550 --> 01:46.820
Pacciani, Piemonte's ace, is injured and can't play in the opener.

01:46.820 --> 01:47.950
What?

01:47.950 --> 01:51.300
Does that mean Hyuga gets to debut as a starter?

01:51.710 --> 01:53.170
Today before practice,

01:53.170 --> 01:56.750
the coach will be making an announcement about Tsubasa Ohzora.

01:56.750 --> 01:58.760
I'll take you to the press room.

01:58.760 --> 02:01.340
It's finally the time to know Tsubasa's position?

02:01.700 --> 02:04.420
Will he get his starting debut at the same time as Hyuga?

02:04.420 --> 02:07.020
That would make some noise in Japan!

02:08.380 --> 02:11.070
Yeah, the moment of truth is finally here.

02:23.670 --> 02:26.590
The opening of the Spanish League is in just one week.

02:26.590 --> 02:28.660
Which position will Tsubasa be playing?

02:28.660 --> 02:32.260
Speaking of which, his jersey number hasn't been announced yet.

02:32.260 --> 02:39.470
True. What kind of exploits will the Number Ten of the Brancos be able to accomplish here?

02:39.470 --> 02:40.870
I'm psyched to find out!

02:40.870 --> 02:41.580
Me, too!

02:41.580 --> 02:46.780
I've been secretly rooting for Ohzora Tsubasa ever since his grade school days,

02:46.780 --> 02:49.740
so being here for the announcement of his position at FC Cataluña

02:49.740 --> 02:50.620
feels like I'm dreaming.

02:50.620 --> 02:52.990
Do you guys think he'll be a regular?

02:52.990 --> 02:54.080
Still not here?

03:42.970 --> 03:45.620
Excuse me, can you please repeat that?

03:45.620 --> 03:49.620
I repeat: Tsubasa Ohzora...

03:52.620 --> 03:54.940
will be playing with Cataluña's B team.

04:05.020 --> 04:10.180
<b>Cross the Bridge of Hope!</b>

04:05.020 --> 04:10.180
<b>Cross the Bridge of Hope!</b>

04:21.920 --> 04:25.150
No way. Cataluña's B team?

04:25.150 --> 04:26.740
The reserve team?

04:26.740 --> 04:29.240
Tsubasa is still young.

04:29.240 --> 04:32.740
Rather than being benched on the first team,

04:32.740 --> 04:35.360
I decided that it's better for him

04:35.360 --> 04:41.420
to get more gametime with Cataluña B, the reserve team.

04:44.900 --> 04:47.750
Tsubasa wanted the playmaker position,

04:47.750 --> 04:53.270
so he's been instructed to get ten goals and ten assists during the upcoming season.

04:55.710 --> 05:01.100
I'm confident he'll accomplish this without any problems.

05:05.230 --> 05:07.500
The announcement is over at this time.

05:11.560 --> 05:14.500
Ten goals, ten assists?

05:23.060 --> 05:29.830
Cataluña's B team is made up of young Division 2 players who were Division 3 players last season.

05:29.830 --> 05:32.260
It doesn't consist of any big-name players.

05:32.260 --> 05:37.060
To score ten goals and make ten assists with such a team will be difficult.

05:37.060 --> 05:38.780
You idiots!

05:39.660 --> 05:41.680
That's not the issue!

05:41.680 --> 05:42.940
Nozaki!

05:42.940 --> 05:49.780
It means that Tsubasa isn't even good enough to substitute for Rivaul!

05:50.450 --> 05:56.780
And Tsubasa's play in the other positions wasn't convincing either.

05:56.780 --> 05:59.390
Tsubasa didn't get any position.

05:59.390 --> 06:03.340
To them, Tsubasa is still not good enough.

06:03.340 --> 06:06.620
He's not at the level necessary to be a regular at Cataluña!

06:06.620 --> 06:09.620
That's what Coach Edward decided.

06:12.990 --> 06:16.360
I shouldn't be idling around here. I need to quickly make a phone call to Japan.

06:16.360 --> 06:19.140
I-I... want to get comments from Tsubasa.

06:19.140 --> 06:24.130
We'll have to completely change our scheduling. This has become a serious matter.

06:25.410 --> 06:26.660
What's wrong?

06:27.630 --> 06:31.660
To the local journalists, this isn't anything big,

06:32.400 --> 06:36.180
but it's big news for the Japanese journalists.

06:36.180 --> 06:40.660
Hello. Can you hear me? I've got serious news from Cataluña.

06:40.660 --> 06:45.510
Ohzora Tsubasa, our hope for the International Cup,

06:45.510 --> 06:48.660
has been sent to the reserve team here in Cataluña!

06:57.140 --> 06:58.180
Tsubasa is judged








too weak!?

06:58.620 --> 06:59.700
Cataluña's wall

06:58.620 --> 06:59.700
<b>proved too thick</b>

07:00.140 --> 07:01.180
<b>Tsubasa:</b>

07:00.140 --> 07:01.180
<b>A failed</b>

07:00.140 --> 07:01.180
<b>transfer?</b>

07:06.850 --> 07:09.700
Geez, what's the meaning of this?

07:14.830 --> 07:18.940
Does this mean that not even Tsubasa's good enough for Europe?

07:33.320 --> 07:35.320
Tsubasa-kun will be all right.

07:35.320 --> 07:37.940
He won't give up because of something like this!

07:38.410 --> 07:39.450
I'm sure!

07:56.460 --> 07:57.670
There!

07:58.790 --> 08:00.100
Was that a good one?

08:00.100 --> 08:01.210
All right!

08:02.880 --> 08:03.980
Ah, got it!

08:18.500 --> 08:22.130
Tsubasa, you'll be the playmaker,

08:23.360 --> 08:26.100
but on the reserve team.

08:36.020 --> 08:37.640
The reserve team....

08:38.280 --> 08:40.320
Cataluña's B team?

08:41.040 --> 08:43.360
I won't be a regular?

09:12.370 --> 09:13.000
Yes.

09:13.000 --> 09:14.150
It's me!

09:14.150 --> 09:15.580
Hyuga-kun?

09:15.580 --> 09:17.530
What the hell is the meaning of this!?

09:17.530 --> 09:19.080
It has to be some kind of mistake, right?

09:19.080 --> 09:21.070
Or are you injured?

09:21.630 --> 09:22.540
No.

09:25.020 --> 09:27.600
It's neither an error nor an injury.

09:29.130 --> 09:32.540
Nothing obligates you to stay in Cataluña or in Spain, Tsubasa.

09:33.550 --> 09:37.850
Come to Italy. The Italian League is one of the best in the world!

09:40.380 --> 09:45.380
There are many teams who don't have a leader and would want you!

09:48.980 --> 09:50.900
Thank you, Hyuga-kun.

09:52.070 --> 09:53.620
But I still...

09:55.060 --> 09:57.300
don't want to leave!

10:35.030 --> 10:41.020
This is not how I want to leave Spain and Barcelona.

10:45.020 --> 10:47.500
S-Shit...!

10:48.540 --> 10:51.460
I'll show that coach...

10:51.940 --> 10:53.440
and my teammates...

10:56.690 --> 10:58.370
and everybody else,

11:01.100 --> 11:03.020
my way of playing soccer!

11:03.750 --> 11:07.900
Tsubasa, which position do you want to play?

11:07.900 --> 11:08.860
Eh?

11:13.880 --> 11:20.460
These last few days, I've made you play various positions.

11:21.350 --> 11:26.150
I want to know which position you want to occupy. {NOTE: We did use "occupy" in ep 45.}

11:28.310 --> 11:30.930
Coach, the position I'd like to play...

11:34.050 --> 11:35.980
is playmaker.

11:35.980 --> 11:41.470
I'll show you all how I <i>really</i> play soccer without holding back!

12:19.190 --> 12:21.150
I finally caught up to you.

12:21.150 --> 12:22.220
Doctor?

12:22.220 --> 12:26.850
I saw you running. That's some speed!

12:26.850 --> 12:29.660
Even with a bike, I had a hard time catching up to you.

12:33.050 --> 12:34.140
I'm relieved.

12:35.660 --> 12:39.500
Even though you're on the reserve team, your expression hasn't changed.

12:40.300 --> 12:40.980
That's right.

12:41.330 --> 12:43.320
You remain faithful to yourself.

12:43.320 --> 12:44.910
Care to follow me somewhere?

12:44.910 --> 12:46.720
I'd like to show you something.

12:46.720 --> 12:47.500
Sure.

13:11.620 --> 13:15.370
Tsubasa, here's the place I wanted to show you.

13:17.340 --> 13:18.710
Keep it together!

13:18.710 --> 13:20.100
All right!

13:19.370 --> 13:20.100
Run!

13:20.100 --> 13:20.860
Over here!

13:20.450 --> 13:21.850
Over here!

13:21.310 --> 13:25.270
It's the field of Cataluña's Junior Team, and from here,

13:25.270 --> 13:25.860
look,

13:26.500 --> 13:30.420
you can see Cataluña B's field, widely known as the "Mini Stadium",

13:30.420 --> 13:33.900
and further away is Cataluña Stadium.

13:33.900 --> 13:38.380
All the kids with high hopes in this town come here to watch,

13:38.380 --> 13:45.380
dreaming about being able to play in the Mini Stadium, then in Cataluña Stadium.

13:45.380 --> 13:49.900
Here's my favorite spot in Barcelona.

13:51.940 --> 13:55.100
People often say how one should aim high,

13:55.100 --> 13:57.900
but here everybody aims for the bottom of this hill.

13:58.460 --> 14:00.100
Did you know, Tsubasa?

14:00.100 --> 14:04.180
We dug into the ground to build the Cataluña stadium.

14:04.190 --> 14:06.140
The field is below ground level.

14:06.140 --> 14:09.370
And that's where the expression "aim for the bottom" comes from?

14:09.370 --> 14:10.240
Yes.

14:11.360 --> 14:14.720
The reserve team of Cataluña is composed of young players.

14:14.720 --> 14:19.090
Between the Mini Stadium and the Cataluña stadium, there is a square,

14:19.090 --> 14:23.250
a park and a Y-shaped bridge.

14:24.420 --> 14:28.180
We call that the "Bridge of Hope."

14:28.740 --> 14:30.180
The Bridge of Hope?

14:30.180 --> 14:36.370
The youngsters from Cataluña's B team persevere with the hope of one day crossing that bridge

14:36.370 --> 14:39.180
in order to play in Cataluña Stadium.

14:39.180 --> 14:49.180
Tsubasa, as a result of your demotion, several club teams will quickly ask you to transfer.

14:49.180 --> 14:55.170
As a professional soccer player, transferring is an option, of course,

14:55.730 --> 14:59.700
but personally, I hope you'll stay.

15:05.190 --> 15:12.140
Actually, like Pinto-kun over there, I've become a fan of yours.

15:12.140 --> 15:15.140
Pass me the ball! Over here! Over here!

15:15.140 --> 15:17.140
Hey, that's true! It's Pinto!

15:17.140 --> 15:18.630
Hold them!

15:23.980 --> 15:24.540
There!

15:26.720 --> 15:29.380
Tsuabsa, you're still young.

15:29.380 --> 15:35.380
I'm positive you'll become the ace of Cataluña in no time.

15:44.020 --> 15:46.260
Here's Tsubasa's Drive Shot!

15:46.260 --> 15:48.420
Take this!

15:50.860 --> 15:53.400
Shoot, I messed up!

15:53.400 --> 15:55.340
What's wrong, Pinto?

15:56.090 --> 15:57.340
Keep it together!

15:57.340 --> 15:59.130
Tsubasa!

16:00.730 --> 16:03.380
Did you watch me play, Tsubasa?

16:03.380 --> 16:05.780
The Drive Shot is still too hard for you.

16:05.780 --> 16:09.020
Aww. I want to play like you!

16:09.020 --> 16:13.020
Score goals with the techniques you've already mastered!

16:13.020 --> 16:14.500
Yes!

16:14.500 --> 16:17.500
All right. Watch me, Tsubasa!

16:42.820 --> 16:43.690
Close!

16:43.690 --> 16:45.340
You almost had him, Pinto!

16:45.340 --> 16:48.580
Yeah, I'll score next time!

17:00.710 --> 17:02.940
Score ten goals and make ten assists.

17:04.420 --> 17:08.830
From the playmaker position you desire,

17:08.830 --> 17:12.940
aim to score ten goals and have ten assists in the upcoming season.

17:12.940 --> 17:16.420
That's a difficult challenge, even on the reserve team,

17:16.420 --> 17:20.460
but I believe you can do it.

17:21.330 --> 17:22.410
Yes.

17:44.290 --> 17:45.220
Nice.

17:46.080 --> 17:47.980
I did it!

17:48.870 --> 17:53.980
That's right. I also have things I need to do.

17:53.980 --> 17:56.470
Tsubasa!

17:58.410 --> 18:00.810
Thank you very much, Doctor.

18:01.590 --> 18:03.690
I like this place, too.

18:04.600 --> 18:05.740
Really?

18:05.740 --> 18:10.230
I decided, while standing on Cataluña Stadium's field,

18:11.280 --> 18:14.500
that I wanted to play soccer there,

18:15.170 --> 18:18.220
and that I would have to be part of this team!

18:18.220 --> 18:20.360
I can't run away from this.

18:20.360 --> 18:24.230
I will also "aim for the bottom" like these kids do!

18:25.140 --> 18:26.060
Tsubasa...

18:30.060 --> 18:33.660
From Cataluña B's Mini Stadium, I will cross the "Bridge of Hope"

18:33.660 --> 18:37.220
and make sure to stand proud in Cataluña Stadium.

18:43.150 --> 18:45.700
And that will be soon.

18:47.020 --> 18:48.180
I swear it will!

19:03.240 --> 19:05.220
We won't see each other for a while.

19:05.220 --> 19:10.790
Since Hyuga might be a sub for the opener because of the injured Piemonte forward,

19:10.790 --> 19:14.780
the bosses are sending me to Italy.

19:14.780 --> 19:18.540
I'm covering the decisive game of the German League's opener

19:18.540 --> 19:25.540
between Wakabayashi's Grunwald, and Schneider's Rotburg.

19:28.940 --> 19:30.740
Till next time, everybody.

19:30.740 --> 19:31.930
Yeah.

19:37.300 --> 19:40.020
What are we going to do, Nozaki-san?

19:40.020 --> 19:41.800
We're staying here.

19:41.800 --> 19:42.700
Nozaki-san?

19:42.700 --> 19:46.280
I believe in Ohzora Tsubasa's abilities.

19:46.280 --> 19:51.620
Sure, if I'm asked whether Tsubasa is better than Rivaul,

19:51.620 --> 19:53.830
I can't say yes.

19:54.620 --> 20:00.440
But is Tsubasa less good than the other players of FC Cataluña?

20:00.440 --> 20:02.620
My answer is definitely no.

20:03.210 --> 20:07.660
That's why I want to believe that Tsubasa will soon be wearing Cataluña's jersey,

20:08.280 --> 20:10.740
standing in Cataluña Stadium,

20:11.660 --> 20:15.200
and soon we'll be able to see him play.

20:21.140 --> 20:25.540
-Italy- Practice Field of FC Piemonte

20:28.240 --> 20:31.540
This is the last scrimmage before the start of the season.

20:31.540 --> 20:34.900
I need to show them what I've got no matter what!

20:38.020 --> 20:42.820
The grading system is simpler for a forward than for another player.

20:42.820 --> 20:46.830
Either he scores goals or he doesn't, Hyuga-kun.

20:47.280 --> 20:52.740
A striker's worth is just like this uniform's colors. Black or white.

20:53.130 --> 20:54.900
I won't let you shoot!

20:56.410 --> 20:57.140
That's rough play!

20:58.400 --> 21:02.540
These rough players are also part of what real Italian soccer is about.

21:02.540 --> 21:06.220
Tsubasa, I'll survive in this club!

21:06.220 --> 21:08.420
Take this!

21:11.770 --> 21:14.990
Even while being out of balance because of these formidable defenders,

21:14.990 --> 21:18.610
Hyuga-kun's right foot hit the ball right in the center.

21:19.920 --> 21:24.620
He has now scored goals in all of the scrimmages to date.

21:24.620 --> 21:27.230
Your percentage of shots on target is 100%.

21:27.230 --> 21:29.530
That's the undisputed best on the team.

21:32.180 --> 21:33.620
All right!

21:34.420 --> 21:36.260
Miss Matsumoto.

21:37.190 --> 21:39.700
Tell Hyuga when he gets back to the bench.

21:45.540 --> 21:47.660
Hyuga-kun!

21:48.890 --> 21:50.670
It looks like the coach has made up his mind.

21:51.830 --> 21:55.130
You'll start in the opening game.

21:58.530 --> 21:59.870
All right!

22:04.020 --> 22:10.540
Preview

22:05.780 --> 22:10.700
In order to play for the first team, I'm training hard on the B team.

22:10.700 --> 22:16.700
Meanwhile, at Piemonte in the Italian League, Hyuga-kun debuts,

22:16.700 --> 22:21.160
but the best defense in the world is standing in his way!

22:21.160 --> 22:23.570
Keep it up, and be sure to score!

22:24.200 --> 22:25.860
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:26.020 --> 22:34.100
Hyuga's Italian Debut

22:26.390 --> 22:28.060
Hyuga's Italian Debut

22:28.060 --> 22:29.730
Look forward to it!

22:29.730 --> 22:31.860
Let's face our future! Kick off!

